$MDESC::Type = "Ski Maps";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Tribes Racer" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Halcyon X" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Dusk" @ 
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Ski through gates of fire as the sun sets.  This map is for extremely skilled skiers only.  At times you will be required to ride loops and fly through the smallest of spaces.    The first player to reach the most laps will be the victor! \n\n<f1>Map by: <f2>=Y2K=jeffro<f1>. This map is built from the HaVoC Map extremities and uses the code built buy the [HvC] team and Natedogg.\n\n<f2>http://havoc.sirris.com";
